*** Keywords ***
CNI_130230_Changing_linkspeed_in_loops
    [Documentation]
    ...    Purpose of this test case is to verify BTS configuration of CABLINK.linkspeed to a different valid value,
    ...    depending on the given BB.RU hardware and the current CABLINK.radioProtocolType configuration.
    ...
    ...    ARGS:
    ...    :param list linkspeed_parameters: (Mandatory) : list of dicts which contain linkspeed value parameter
    ...                                                    for specific cablink, example:
    ...                     linkspeed_parameters = [
    ...                                                {
    ...                                                    'dist_name': 'MRBTS-{}/EQM-1/HWTOP-1/CABLINK-1',
    ...                                                    'parameter': 'linkSpeed',
    ...                                                    'planned_value': 'eCpri10',
    ...                                                    'origin_value': 'eCpri25',
    ...                                                }
    ...                                            ]
    ...    :param list max_linkspeed_parameters: (Mandatory) : list of dicts which contain linkMaxPhysicalCapacity
    ...                                                        value parameter for specific cablink, example:
    ...                     max_linkspeed_parameters = [
    ...                                                    {
    ...                                                        'dist_name': 'MRBTS-{}/EQM_R-1/HWTOP_R-1/CABLINK_R-1001',
    ...                                                        'parameter': 'linkMaxPhysicalCapacity',
    ...                                                        'planned_value': '10312',
    ...                                                        'origin_value': '25781',
    ...                                                    }
    ...                                                ]
    ...    :param int iterations: (Optional) : number of iterations in loop, default is 20
    ...    :param str bts_type: (Optional) : type of BTS, default is gnb, possible values: gnb, enb
    ...    :param int bts_id: (Optional) : BTS id, default is 0

    [Arguments]    ${linkspeed_parameters}
    ...            ${max_linkspeed_parameters}
    ...            ${iterations}=${20}
    ...            ${bts_type}=gnb
    ...            ${bts_id}=${0}

    ${linkspeed_params_count}    Get Length    ${linkspeed_parameters}
    FOR  ${iter}    IN RANGE    ${iterations}
        FOR    ${index}    IN RANGE    ${linkspeed_params_count}
            Change Cablink Linkspeed And Verify LinkMaxPhysicalCapacity
            ...                                          linkspeed_parameters=${linkspeed_parameters}[${index}]
            ...                                          max_linkspeed_parameters=${max_linkspeed_parameters}[${index}]
            ...                                          value_key=planned_value
            ...                                          bts_type=${bts_type}
            ...                                          bts_id=${bts_id}
            logger.Log Info To Console                   Waiting for all cells to be Onair after change Cablink linkspeed
            Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                  900 sec
            ...                                          30 sec
            ...                                          ${bts_type}cell.Verify All Cells Are Onair
            ...                                          bts_id=${bts_id}
            logger.Log Info To Console                   All cells are Onair
            Change Cablink Linkspeed And Verify LinkMaxPhysicalCapacity
            ...                                          linkspeed_parameters=${linkspeed_parameters}[${index}]
            ...                                          max_linkspeed_parameters=${max_linkspeed_parameters}[${index}]
            ...                                          value_key=origin_value
            ...                                          bts_type=${bts_type}
            ...                                          bts_id=${bts_id}
            logger.Log Info To Console                   Waiting for all cells to be Onair after restoring original value
            Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                  900 sec
            ...                                          30 sec
            ...                                          ${bts_type}cell.Verify All Cells Are Onair
            ...                                          bts_id=${bts_id}
            logger.Log Info To Console                   All cells are Onair
        END
    END


Verify that current parameter value is different from planned one
    [Arguments]    ${dist_name}
    ...            ${parameter}
    ...            ${planned_value}
    ...            ${bts_id}=${0}
    ...            ${du_id}=${0}
    ...            ${bts_type}=gnb

    ${param_dict}=                                       Create Dict With Parameter To Verify
    ...                                                  dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                                  parameter=${parameter}
    ...                                                  value=${planned_value}
    # We expect that verifing actual parameter value will return error, because actual parameter value should be
    # different from planned_value
    ${msg}=                                              Run Keyword And Expect Error
    ...                                                  *
    ...                                                  ${bts_type}bbu.Verify Configuration Parameters Values
    ...                                                  param_dict=${param_dict}
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    ...                                                  du_id=${du_id}
    Should Contain Any                                   ${msg}
    ...                                                  IncorrectParameterValue:
    ...                                                  DataNotAvailable:
    ${msg_parts}=                                        Split String
    ...                                                  ${msg}
    ${param_value}=                                      Set Variable If
    ...                                                  "IncorrectParameterValue:" in ${msg_parts}
    ...                                                  ${msg_parts}[-1]
    ...                                                  `<empty_value>`

    logger.Log Info To Console               msg=Parameter `${parameter}` has different ${param_value} value than planned `${planned_value}` value
    ...                                      log_hierarchy=${2}

Verify that current parameter value is as expected
    [Arguments]    ${dist_name}
    ...            ${parameter}
    ...            ${expected_value}
    ...            ${bts_id}=${0}
    ...            ${du_id}=${0}
    ...            ${bts_type}=gnb

    ${param_dict}=                                          Create Dict With Parameter To Verify
    ...                                                     dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                                     parameter=${parameter}
    ...                                                     value=${expected_value}
    Run Keyword                                             ${bts_type}bbu.Verify Configuration Parameters Values
    ...                                                     param_dict=${param_dict}
    ...                                                     bts_id=${bts_id}
    ...                                                     du_id=${du_id}
    logger.Log Info To Console                              msg=Parameter `${parameter}` has expected `${expected_value}` value
    ...                                                     log_hierarchy=${2}

Update BTS parameter
    [Arguments]    ${dist_name}
    ...            ${parameter}
    ...            ${new_value}
    ...            ${bts_id}=${0}
    ...            ${sleep_time}=120s
    ...            ${bts_type}=gnb

    ${adjusted_dist_name}=                               Run Keyword
    ...                                                  ${bts_type}bbu.adjust_dist_name
    ...                                                  dist_name=${dist_name}
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    logger.Log Info To Console                           msg=Updating parameter `${parameter}` for `${adjusted_dist_name}`
    Verify that current parameter value is different from planned one
    ...                                                  dist_name=${adjusted_dist_name}
    ...                                                  parameter=${parameter}
    ...                                                  planned_value=${new_value}
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    Run Keyword                                          ${bts_type}scf.perform_configuration_parameter_recommissioning
    ...                                                  dist_name=${adjusted_dist_name}
    ...                                                  parameter=${parameter}
    ...                                                  value=${new_value}
    ...                                                  operation=update
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    ...                                                  timeout=600
    logger.Log Info To Console                           msg=Changing parameter `${parameter}` value to `${new_value}`
    ...                                                  log_hierarchy=${2}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                          300 sec
    ...                                                  30 sec
    ...                                                  Verify that current parameter value is as expected
    ...                                                  dist_name=${adjusted_dist_name}
    ...                                                  parameter=${parameter}
    ...                                                  expected_value=${new_value}
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}

Change Cablink Linkspeed And Verify LinkMaxPhysicalCapacity
    [Arguments]    ${linkspeed_parameters}
    ...            ${max_linkspeed_parameters}
    ...            ${value_key}
    ...            ${bts_type}=gnb
    ...            ${bts_id}=${0}

    Update BTS parameter                                 dist_name=${linkspeed_parameters}[dist_name]
    ...                                                  parameter=${linkspeed_parameters}[parameter]
    ...                                                  new_value=${linkspeed_parameters}[${value_key}]
    ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                          300 sec
    ...                                                  30 sec
    ...                                                  Verify that current parameter value is as expected
    ...                                                  dist_name=${max_linkspeed_parameters}[dist_name]
    ...                                                  parameter=${max_linkspeed_parameters}[parameter]
    ...                                                  expected_value=${max_linkspeed_parameters}[${value_key}]
    ...                                                  bts_id=${bts_id}
    ...                                                  bts_type=${bts_type}


Create Dict With Parameter To Verify
    [Arguments]    ${dist_name}
    ...            ${parameter}
    ...            ${value}

    ${inner_dict}=                                       Create Dictionary
    ...                                                  ${parameter}=${value}
    ${result}=                                           Create Dictionary
    ...                                                  ${dist_name}=${inner_dict}
    [Return]    ${result}
